<title>USA: Merry Land completes Polos East buy.</title>
<headline>Merry Land completes Polos East buy.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merry Land &amp; Investment Co Inc said Friday it completed the purchase of Polos East for $16 million in cash.</p>
<p>Polos East is a 308-unit luxury apartment community located in east Orlando, Florida.</p>
<p>Merry Land is a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) which operates and owns apartments.</p>
</text>
